BandIt v2 multilingual cinematic-audio separator

Purpose
-------
This ONNX graph estimates speech, music, and sound-effects masks for a mono
48 kHz complex spectrogram. Radioify performs the STFT, ISTFT, stereo-channel
handling, and overlap-add outside the graph.

Source and attribution
----------------------
The weights originate from checkpoint-multi.ckpt in:

  Model Weights for "Remastering Divide and Remaster: A Cinematic Audio
  Source Separation Dataset with Multilingual Support"
  Karn Watcharasupat, Chih-Wei Wu, and Iroro Orife
  DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.12701995
  https://zenodo.org/records/12701995

